{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fill Up The Hole</strong> is a short incremental game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw Garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your peons automatically gather garbage and throw it into the hole. The more they throw, the more progress you make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/peon_throw_small.gif?t=1748781787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your village, put your peons to work, and maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/city_small.gif?t=1748781787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock upgrades and abilities to enhance your buildings and peons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/upgrade_small.gif?t=1748781787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Strategies</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your base by taking the time to remove rocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and upgrade different buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The order of the buildings can make a difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance the abilities of your peons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new research, talents, and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/bull_small.gif?t=1748781787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343160?t=1748781787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/1bc9607d3d88789644e3b8dd9584e9788eb4c3d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748781787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/6a2a28e27547d4f4eb054315ee9aeff971f4baed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748781787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/6a2a28e27547d4f4eb054315ee9aeff971f4baed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748781787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3630390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fill Up The Hole</strong> is a short incremental game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw Garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your peons automatically gather garbage and throw it into the hole. The more they throw, the more progress you make!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/peon_throw_small.gif?t=1748781787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your village, put your peons to work, and maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i